      "New definitions added: 'Prescribed Form' (latest version of corresponding form appearing on the Website) and 'Website' (OPA microFIT website URL). 'Existing Building' definition expanded to allow OPA written confirmation to deem a building an Existing Building for Rooftop Facility purposes; Rooftop Facility definition retains and references Existing Building."}
     {:section
